In order to define the meta data that describes the bindings to the DNN SVD uses a single configuration file which is set by the dnn.metadata setting in the main configuration file.
Each binding is described by a number of settings, which follow this naming scheme:
input.&lt;tensorname&gt;.&lt;key&gt; = &lt;value&gt;

